{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0001_presentation_over_coverage", "label": "ADR-0001: Presentation over coverage", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0001-presentation-over-coverage.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The tool definitions cost about 18,900 tokens per turn. Full ADT coverage (~350 tools, from 215 discovery collections) would cost about 51,000. The smallest client in scope (an 8B model with a 128k window) is the design target, and reliability there came from better tools, not more of them. The tool counts disagree across documents: this ADR's title says 139 and its body 138, while Tool-Reference lists 128."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0001_presentation_over_coverage_coverage_as_diagnostic", "label": "Coverage as a diagnostic, not a target", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0001-presentation-over-coverage.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The gap against adtDiscovery is reported so it stays visible, but a gap is not a defect. Wrapping ~60 of 215 collections is deliberate, not unfinished."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0001_presentation_over_coverage_demand_is_the_evidence", "label": "Demand is the evidence for adding a tool", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0001-presentation-over-coverage.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A capability that genuinely blocks a real task is still a reason to add a tool. The discovery document is not."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0001_presentation_over_coverage_small_model_design_target", "label": "8B-model / 128k-window client as design target", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0001-presentation-over-coverage.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"s